{"id":"8372bbf882660759","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-classical-proof-system.md","title":"固定的一阶经典 Hilbert 系统","display":"df-classical-proof-system — 固定的一阶经典 Hilbert 系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-classical-proof-system","aliases":["20-df-classical-proof-system"],"display":"df-classical-proof-system — 固定的一阶经典 Hilbert 系统","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 的逻辑背景；经典系统的本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-classical-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-classical-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classical-proof-system — 固定的一阶经典 Hilbert 系统"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 的逻辑背景；经典系统的本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\phi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 为项；FreeFor 表示递归替换中没有自由变量被捕获；FV 为按语法树递归所得自由变量集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_H:=\\{\\phi\\to(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\\n(\\phi\\to(\\psi\\to\\theta))\\to((\\phi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\theta)),\\\n(\\neg\\psi\\to\\neg\\phi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\forall v\\phi\\to\\phi[t/v]:\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\forall v(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\forall v\\psi):v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{t=t,\\ t=u\\to(\\phi[t/v]\\to\\phi[u/v]):\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(u,v,\\phi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rules}_H:=\\{((\\phi,\\phi\\to\\psi),\\psi),\\\n((\\phi,),\\forall v\\phi):\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L),v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\qquad\nP_H:=(\\mathrm{Ax}_H,\\mathrm{Rules}_H).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_H:=\\{\\phi\\to(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\\n(\\phi\\to(\\psi\\to\\theta))\\to((\\phi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\theta)),\\\n(\\neg\\psi\\to\\neg\\phi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\forall v\\phi\\to\\phi[t/v]:\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\forall v(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\forall v\\psi):v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{t=t,\\ t=u\\to(\\phi[t/v]\\to\\phi[u/v]):\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(u,v,\\phi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rules}_H:=\\{((\\phi,\\phi\\to\\psi),\\psi),\\\n((\\phi,),\\forall v\\phi):\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L),v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\qquad\nP_H:=(\\mathrm{Ax}_H,\\mathrm{Rules}_H).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>各集合按已显示变量的全部合法取值取实例。一般化规则的一个前提写为长度 1 的序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\phi)\">\\((\\phi)\\)</span>；modus ponens 有两个前提。默认理论 T 由句子组成，所以一般化不会捕获开放假设的自由变量；对有开放假设的推导必须另记录并检查一般化限制。这里把原来只口头指定的 P 的逻辑公理与规则补成显式结构。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 的逻辑背景；经典系统的本地展开；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_H:=\\{\\phi\\to(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\\n(\\phi\\to(\\psi\\to\\theta))\\to((\\phi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\theta)),\\\n(\\neg\\psi\\to\\neg\\phi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\forall v\\phi\\to\\phi[t/v]:\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\forall v(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\phi\\to\\forall v\\psi):v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{t=t,\\ t=u\\to(\\phi[t/v]\\to\\phi[u/v]):\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(u,v,\\phi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rules}_H:=\\{((\\phi,\\phi\\to\\psi),\\psi),\\\n((\\phi,),\\forall v\\phi):\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L),v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\qquad\nP_H:=(\\mathrm{Ax}_H,\\mathrm{Rules}_H).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"(\\phi)","display":false}],"bytes":2102,"backlinks":[{"id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。"},{"id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。"},{"id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。"}],"outgoing":["0c35680c0004f5e2"]}